cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Spatial Research Suite — Geospatial & Remote-Sensing Analysis Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An open R / Shiny + Google Earth Engine pipeline for reproducible, publishable
  remote-sensing research: land-cover and change analysis, spectral-index libraries,
  trend and correlation statistics, and a marine/coral module. Includes a Maya Bay
  (Ko Phi Phi Leh, Thailand) case study using the 2018–2022 tourism closure as a
  natural experiment to separate tourism impact from climate impact on the reef.
type: software
